 21+  0000              MEDIUM_GREEN EQU 2
 22+  0000              LIGHT_GREEN  EQU 3
 23+  0000              DARK_BLUE    EQU 4
 24+  0000              LIGHT_BLUE   EQU 5
 25+  0000              DARK_RED     EQU 6
